<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>The Lamest</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="group" xml:id="v1">Lames, lilbubblegum</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">The Lamest</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">2oLGvSNFsi9zHjIF4oIA5S</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:01.510" end="00:03.010">And that's on me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:02.530" end="00:04.860">How you see me walking with the Nikes on my feet</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:04.860" end="00:07.236">Hanging with the boys and we riding ten deep</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:07.236" end="00:09.593">Working in the night while you hoes go sleep</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:09.593" end="00:12.110">Every fxckin' week, and that's on me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:12.110" end="00:14.545">How you see me walking with the Nikes on my feet</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.545" end="00:16.848">Hanging with the boys and we riding ten deep</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.848" end="00:19.181">Working in the night while you hoes go sleep</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.181" end="00:21.182">Every fzckin' week</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.182" end="00:23.606">Wanna whip 200 in a viper</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.606" end="00:26.012">Popping like a bullet coming out a fxckin sniper</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.012" end="00:28.218">Boy talk sweet but I'm nicer</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.218" end="00:30.992">B!tch is talking sh!t I won't hesitate to strike her</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.992" end="00:33.326">Chillin' in the back I'm feeling cold without the ice</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.326" end="00:35.656">Me and bubblegum in the cut like a knife</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.656" end="00:37.882">In the night, working while you sleep out of sight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.882" end="00:40.440">Flying higher soaring like a kite</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.440" end="00:42.651">Me and Lames yeah we finna kill this hoe</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.651" end="00:45.083">They be talking all that smack and I don't think they want this smoke</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.083" end="00:47.386">I be feeling like I'm Anna with the Ruger let it go</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.386" end="00:50.315">Never fold, too cold, Todoroki neck froze like brrr</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.315" end="00:53.078">I just seen a thot imma have to hit a skrrr</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.078" end="00:55.390">I just seen an opp imma have to get 'em murked</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.390" end="00:56.890">I don't wanna stop</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.417" end="00:57.917">All this money and this guap</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.578" end="00:59.078">New drop, that's hot</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.604" end="01:00.104">And that's on me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.080" end="01:02.644">How you see me walking with the Nikes on my feet</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.644" end="01:04.910">Hanging with the boys and we riding ten deep</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.910" end="01:07.309">Working in the night while you hoes go sleep</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.309" end="01:09.766">Every fxckin week, and that's on me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.766" end="01:11.989">How you see me walking with the Nikes on my feet</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.989" end="01:14.356">Hanging with the boys and we riding ten deep</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.356" end="01:16.754">Working in the night while you hoes go sleep</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.754" end="01:20.754">Every fxckin week</p></div></body></tt>